1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:05,568
Hello, hello!

5
00:00:06,118 --> 00:00:09,162
Let's learn our ABCs together.

6
00:00:09,412 --> 00:00:11,589
Ready? Clap with me!

7
00:00:14,589 --> 00:00:16,637
A is for apple.

8
00:00:17,137 --> 00:00:18,931
A, A, apple!

9
00:00:20,281 --> 00:00:22,186
B is for ball.

10
00:00:22,686 --> 00:00:24,521
B, B, ball!

11
00:00:25,871 --> 00:00:27,847
What letter is this?

12
00:00:29,847 --> 00:00:32,085
C! C is for cat.

13
00:00:32,635 --> 00:00:33,582
Meow!

14
00:00:34,932 --> 00:00:36,766
D is for duck.

15
00:00:37,266 --> 00:00:39,141
D, D, duck!

16
00:00:39,691 --> 00:00:40,779
Quack, quack!

17
00:00:42,129 --> 00:00:44,010
E is for egg.

18
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:46,224
E, E, egg!

19
00:00:46,774 --> 00:00:47,964
Yummy egg!

20
00:00:49,314 --> 00:00:51,290
What letter is this?

21
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:55,608
F! F is for fish.

22
00:00:56,958 --> 00:00:58,863
G is for grapes.

23
00:00:59,363 --> 00:01:01,520
G, G, grapes!

24
00:01:02,870 --> 00:01:04,775
H is for hat.

25
00:01:05,275 --> 00:01:07,009
H, H, hat!

26
00:01:08,359 --> 00:01:10,335
What letter is this?

27
00:01:12,335 --> 00:01:14,996
I! I is for ice cream.

28
00:01:16,346 --> 00:01:18,322
J is for juice.

29
00:01:18,822 --> 00:01:20,879
J, J, juice!

30
00:01:22,229 --> 00:01:24,134
K is for kite.

31
00:01:24,634 --> 00:01:26,549
K, K, kite!

32
00:01:27,099 --> 00:01:28,369
Whee, up high!

33
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:31,552
L is for leaf.

34
00:01:32,052 --> 00:01:33,827
L, L, leaf!

35
00:01:35,177 --> 00:01:37,153
What letter is this?

36
00:01:39,153 --> 00:01:41,532
M! M is for moon.

37
00:01:42,832 --> 00:01:44,717
Wow, we're halfway there!

38
00:01:44,717 --> 00:01:46,400
Give Teddy a big clap!

39
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:49,092
Thank you!

40
00:01:49,092 --> 00:01:50,387
Let's keep going!

41
00:01:51,987 --> 00:01:53,844
N is for nest.

42
00:01:54,344 --> 00:01:56,461
N, N, nest!

43
00:01:57,811 --> 00:01:59,883
O is for orange.

44
00:02:00,383 --> 00:02:02,379
O, O, orange!

45
00:02:03,729 --> 00:02:05,705
What letter is this?

46
00:02:07,705 --> 00:02:09,983
P! P is for pig.

47
00:02:10,533 --> 00:02:11,662
Oink, oink!

48
00:02:13,012 --> 00:02:14,917
Q is for quilt.

49
00:02:15,417 --> 00:02:17,534
Q, Q, quilt!

50
00:02:18,884 --> 00:02:20,955
R is for rainbow.

51
00:02:21,455 --> 00:02:23,512
R, R, rainbow!

52
00:02:24,062 --> 00:02:25,271
So pretty!

53
00:02:26,621 --> 00:02:28,597
What letter is this?

54
00:02:30,597 --> 00:02:32,876
S! S is for sun.

55
00:02:33,426 --> 00:02:34,918
Hello, sun!

56
00:02:36,268 --> 00:02:38,220
T is for tree.

57
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,635
T, T, tree!

58
00:02:41,985 --> 00:02:44,128
U is for umbrella.

59
00:02:44,628 --> 00:02:46,926
U, U, umbrella!

60
00:02:48,276 --> 00:02:50,253
What letter is this?

61
00:02:52,253 --> 00:02:54,652
V! V is for van.

62
00:02:56,002 --> 00:02:58,502
W is for watermelon.

63
00:02:59,002 --> 00:03:02,066
W, W, watermelon!

64
00:03:02,616 --> 00:03:04,048
Yum, yum!

65
00:03:05,398 --> 00:03:07,564
X is for xylophone.

66
00:03:08,064 --> 00:03:10,463
X, X, xylophone!

67
00:03:11,013 --> 00:03:12,828
Ding, ding, ding!

68
00:03:14,178 --> 00:03:16,154
What letter is this?

69
00:03:18,154 --> 00:03:20,654
Y! Y is for yo-yo.

70
00:03:22,004 --> 00:03:24,123
Z is for zebra.

71
00:03:24,623 --> 00:03:26,720
Z, Z, zebra!

72
00:03:27,270 --> 00:03:28,036
Neigh!

73
00:03:29,636 --> 00:03:32,237
Yay! We learned A to Z!

74
00:03:32,787 --> 00:03:34,977
Let's say them all together.

75
00:03:35,227 --> 00:03:37,871
A, B, C, D, E, F, G.

76
00:03:37,871 --> 00:03:41,203
H, I, J, K, L, M, N, O, P.

77
00:03:41,453 --> 00:03:43,860
Q, R, S, T, U, V.

78
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:46,025
W, X, Y, and Z!

79
00:03:46,575 --> 00:03:48,813
Great job, little learner!

80
00:03:49,363 --> 00:03:51,251
Share Mimzi with a friend,

81
00:03:51,251 --> 00:03:53,791
and subscribe for more learning fun!

82
00:03:54,341 --> 00:03:55,277
Next time,

83
00:03:55,277 --> 00:03:57,507
let's learn our first words.

84
00:03:57,757 --> 00:03:59,128
Bye bye!
